Package: clip-sync-ai
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ClipSyncAI <noreply@localhost>
Depends: libgtk-3-0, libsecret-1-0, zenity
Description: Clipboard note-taking and transcription with on-device AI
 ClipSyncAI turns whatever you copy into editable notes, recognizes voice
 with on-device Whisper, and lets you chat with a local or cloud model.
 .
 Works with a connected AI gateway (Ollama, OpenAI-compatible endpoints, or a
 custom gateway). Voice transcription requires the on-device Whisper engine;
 OCR is currently a mobile-only feature.
